{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_009rit01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_009rit01_title", "source_sha256": "b491267f24236b7ebe5b11646ffd6d5118798529a6404a0a952ffa548000c986", "ja": "律子とおでかけ1", "zh": "和律子外出1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_009rit01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_009rit01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4c8eac4f2e8534c969e1873747cbfe3bfe706e5eba6d777f29494bb210f56130", "ja": "律子とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是与律子外出的片段。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_009rit01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_009rit01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2bd2d2461ffbdb772c99bffd3ed1f5c8df1a7572576908f1b5e8907717a828eb", "ja": "（福島の旅館で律子のトークショーが開催された。\n町おこしの話にも踏み込み、興味深い内容だったな）", "zh": "（律子在福岛的旅馆举办了脱口秀。还谈到了振兴小镇的话题，内容真是令人印象深刻啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_009rit01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_009rit01_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "198cdcee83f63d81350455bd52e665716a0bdbbfd8b03150b831f7a4e7725c3a", "ja": "……それでですね。私としては、\nもっと磐梯山を推していくべきじゃないかと。", "zh": "……所以呢。我个人觉得，\n是不是应该把磐梯山作为更大的卖点来推广。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_009rit01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_009rit01_1002_009rit", "source_sha256": "d0e64a1c2bb6d0533300edbed837354fd22eaa1f917d4d23a8535c382ec13b71", "ja": "たとえば登山客にターゲットを絞って……って、\n{$P$}、聞いてます？", "zh": "比如把目标锁定在登山客身上……话说，{$P$}，你有在听吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_009rit01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_009rit01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a8cbdd3e2255f672537dce82de404308b5d2e4d3a32b8dbb0fbeec2df5e83d69", "ja": "うん、聞いてるよ。\nさすが律子、よく分析してるな。", "zh": "嗯，我在听。\n不愧是律子，分析得真透彻。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_009rit01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_009rit01_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "4d22956983a02902ff691baee90ffedf0f7defb0f94b5102631c948abe4d6cf4", "ja": "ええ。でも、分析はあくまで机上のものですし。\n私って結構、頭でっかちになりがちなので……。", "zh": "嗯。不过，分析终究只是纸上谈兵。\n我这个人也挺容易变得只会纸上谈兵的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_009rit01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_009rit01_1005_009rit", "source_sha256": "5d2280daad8015c2418d055cc471243e46fabf3c4465880b9d7918d2b89b2e14", "ja": "自分の提案に具体的な説得力を持たせるためにも、\nここは私自身が、磐梯山に登ってみようかと。", "zh": "为了让自己的提案更具具体的说服力，我想还是由我亲自登上磐梯山比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_009rit01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_009rit01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "bbcce91e1a545fea94520467ef5e8a8a92779a6ecd533ee856ab569af5132e18", "ja": "登山……いや、今は無理だぞ？\n冬だし、雪山だし……。", "zh": "爬山……不，现在可不行吧？\n毕竟是冬天，而且还是雪山……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_009rit01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_009rit01_1007_009rit", "source_sha256": "d546fad0ca4ec21fecf17e926d35c5db909a0f5251fef5d7e04ab3064cbf1f81", "ja": "もちろん、今とは言いませんよ？\n春か秋か、登山にいい季節になったらです。", "zh": "当然不是现在啦？\n等到春天或秋天这种适合登山的季节再说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_009rit01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_009rit01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c6d61c9e5758c7394db6ee938094d2feb4ab14241aca58f02d151c85bc398954", "ja": "それなら良かった。そうだな、次の仕事にも\n繋がりそうだし、いいんじゃないかな？", "zh": "那就好。确实，这样也能和下次的工作联系起来，挺不错的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_009rit01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_009rit01_1009_009rit", "source_sha256": "eb141a9308b9b3e61de4642368eb72ff0f159cdb7033fa3fc774f66f5d4fe49a", "ja": "ですよね！　という訳で、カメラマン役任せました！\n登山に向けて、体、作っておいてくださいね♪", "zh": "就是嘛！所以，摄影师的工作就交给你了！\n为了登山，记得提前锻炼好身体哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_009rit01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_009rit01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "f8018db6fc8c5ea01f48f4cb34d3524778bf87133ec27a4898a2f77c8fc057c4", "ja": "（俺も山に登る前提なのか……いや、\n律子に負けないよう、まずは走り込みからかな！）", "zh": "（原来默认我也要一起爬山吗……不对，为了不输给律子，还是先从跑步训练开始吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
